#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:117
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Replicate mouse, keyboard and gamepad connected to the headset as virtual "
"devices on PC.\n"
"Replicated devices will appear as if they were plugged to the PC, some keys "
"may be reserved by the headset OS and not be available. Gamepad is also "
"available without virtual devices for applications that access it through "
"OpenXR."
msgstr ""
"Réplique souris, clavier et manette connectés au casque comme périphériques "
"virtuels sur l'ordinateur.\n"
"Les périphériques répliques apparaissent comme si connectés à l'ordinateur, "
"certaines touches peuvent être réservées par le système du casque et ne pas "
"être disponibles. La manette est aussi disponible pour les applications "
"compatibles via OpenXR sans utiliser les périphériques virtuels."

#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:122
#, kde-format
msgid "Enable debug window"
msgstr "Activer la fenêtre de débogage"

#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:129
#, kde-format
msgid "Enable SteamVR tracked devices support"
msgstr "Activer le support des manettes SteamVR"

#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:132
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Allows the use of lighthouse-based controllers and trackers.\n"
"Requires SteamVR to be installed.\n"
"Devices must be be powered on before connecting to Wyrm.\n"
"An external tool such as motoc is needed for calibration."
msgstr ""
"Permet d'utiliser les manettes et trackers utilisant Lighthouse.\n"
"Nécessite SteamVR installé.\n"
"Les manettes et trackers doivent être allumés avant de connecter le casque à "
"Wyrm.\n"
"Un utilitaire tiers tel que motoc est nécessaire pour la calibration."

#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:138
#, kde-format
msgid "Clamp extrapolation for SteamVR tracked devices"
msgstr "Limiter l'extrapolation des manettes"

#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:142
#, kde-format
msgid "SteamVR max pose extrapolation"
msgstr "Durée maximale"

#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:152
#, kde-format
msgctxt "value display for SteamVR max pose extrapolation"
msgid "%1ms"
msgid_plural "%1ms"
msgstr[0] "%1ms"
msgstr[1] "%1ms"

#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:157
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Maximum time in milliseconds that poses may be extrapolated ahead for "
"SteamVR tracked devices. Tune this value if you experience jittery or wobbly "
"tracking."
msgstr ""
"Durée maximale en millisecondes pour l'extrapolation des positions des "
"manettes suivies par SteamVR. Permet d'adapter entre un suivi trop mou ou "
"trop bruité."

#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:162
#, kde-format
msgid "SteamVR joystick deadzone"
msgstr "Zone morte sticks SteamVR"

#: dashboard/qml/SettingsPage.qml:177
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Deadzone to apply to joysticks on lighthouse-tracked controllers, such as "
"Index.\n"
"For standalone controllers, deadzones may be adjusted via the headset's "
"system settings."
msgstr ""
"Zone morte pour les sticks sur les manettes Lighthouse comme le Valve "
"Index.\n"
"Pour les manettes associées au casque, les zones mortes se configurent via "
"les paramètres du casque lui-même."

